              ╭──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────╮              
              │help                                                                  │              
              │sending and editing                                                   │              
              │  enter             send the draft, or queue it while a turn runs     │              
              │  ctrl+l            send now, cancelling the running turn (asks first)│              
              │  alt+enter, ctrl+j newline (shift+enter where the terminal sends it) │              
              │  ctrl+v            paste                                             │              
              │  esc               cancel the turn, or close what is open            │              
              │  ctrl+c            cancel the turn and everything queued, then quit  │              
              │  ctrl+d            quit                                              │              
              │queued messages                                                       │              
              │  ↑                 select a queued message                           │              
              │  enter on a row    edit it in place                                  │              
              │  backspace         cancel it                                         │              
              │  ctrl+l on a row   send it now instead of the running turn           │              
              │  hover a row       [send now] [edit] [cancel]                        │              
              │mode                                                                  │              
              │  shift+tab         cycle the mode: agent, plan, ask                  │              
              │  click ◆ chip      cycle the mode from status row 2                  │              
              │moving and scrolling                                                  │              
              │  ↑ ↓               queued messages, sub-agent rows, or a list inside…│              
              │  pgup pgdn, wheel  scroll the transcript                             │              
              │  tab, enter        on the slash menu, accept the highlighted row    ▼│              
              │↑↓ · pgup/pgdn · esc closes                                           │              
